# /opt/sunnitai-be/.env.worker2 -- read by sunnitai-ingest-2 AFTER /opt/sunnitai-be/.env (same owner and mode 600
# as .env): only what differs for the second worker. The failed folder stays shared.
BATCH_UPLOAD_DIR=/opt/sunnitai-be/document_upload_2
BATCH_LOG_FILE=/var/log/sunnitai-ingest-2.log
# Lever 5, the chunk waits (ops/be2/patch_ingest_lever5.py applied first; runbook 3d). Uncomment, restart worker 2:
# ANALISI_CHUNK_TIMEOUTS=40,40,40
# Lever 4, the cheap path (ops/be2/patch_ingest_lever4.py applied first). Uncomment and restart sunnitai-ingest-2:
# INGEST_SKIP_ANALYSIS=1
